sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Buyer (agent / curl)
    participant S as Seller (Next.js withX402)
    participant F as Facilitator (x402.org)
    participant U as USDC contract (Base Sepolia)
    B->>S: GET /api/weather
    S-->>B: 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED header (base64 JSON: amount 10000, USDC, payTo)
    Note over B: Sign EIP-3009 transferWithAuthorization (no gas, no tx yet)
    B->>S: GET /api/weather + PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header
    S->>F: POST /verify
    F-->>S: isValid (ng: invalid_exact_evm_insufficient_balance when buyer has no USDC; observed)
    S->>S: run handler
    Note over S: settle only when the response status is below 400
    S->>F: POST /settle
    F->>U: transferWithAuthorization (facilitator pays gas; buyer ETH was 0)
    U-->>F: tx hash
    F-->>S: success + transaction
    S-->>B: 200 + JSON + PAYMENT-RESPONSE header
